  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2014/07/IMG_0287.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif;\">El s&aacute;bado de las fiestas de San Crist&oacute;bal en Onda ha sido eminentemente taurino, aunque con paella para reponer fuerzas, tras el encierro campero, con caballos y mansos por el r&iacute;o Mijares, y las vaquillas, y antes del toro de la ganader&iacute;a El Gallo.</span></span></p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/dissabtesantcristofolribesalbes14/dsc_0002.jpg\" alt=\"dsc_0002\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/dissabtesantcristofolribesalbes14/dsc_0003.jpg\" alt=\"dsc_0003\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/dissabtesantcristofolribesalbes14/dsc_0004.jpg\" alt=\"dsc_0004\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/dissabtesantcristofolribesalbes14/dsc_0005.jpg\" alt=\"dsc_0005\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/dissabtesantcristofolribesalbes14/dsc_0007.jpg\" alt=\"dsc_0007\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/dissabtesantcristofolribesalbes14/dsc_0008.jpg\" alt=\"dsc_0008\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/dissabtesantcristofolribesalbes14/dsc_0009.jpg\" alt=\"dsc_0009\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/dissabtesantcristofolribesalbes14/dsc_0010.jpg\" alt=\"dsc_0010\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"htt